  refine LanglandsTunnell.Converse.not_agreesAwayFromFinite_eisensteinTableOf_of_hasProd_eulerProduct_unitary_twist
    M Ψ ?_ Ψ.level Ψ.level_ne_bot μ₁ μ₂ h₁ h₂ c₁ c₂
